flowchart LR
  API[API logs/metrics] --> LAW[Log Analytics]
  OUT[Outbox logs + backlog age] --> LAW
  W[Worker logs + scan_attempts] --> LAW
  SB[Service Bus active + DLQ] --> MON[Azure Monitor]
  PG[PostgreSQL CPU/memory/storage] --> MON
  ACA[Container Apps revisions/5xx] --> MON
  LAW --> ALERT[Action Group / incident]
  MON --> ALERT
  ALERT --> RUNBOOK[Runbook + rollback]
